#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0095-A expect=violation domain=SUPPSV
#note "In SDTM-IG 3.4 the SV exemption no longer applies: a SUPP-- referencing SV (class SPECIAL PURPOSE, not general-observation, not DM) fires."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 RDOMAIN=SV
#library dataset-class SV "SPECIAL PURPOSE"
dataset SUPPSV class=RELATIONSHIP label="Supplemental Qualifiers for SV"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col RDOMAIN type=Char label="Related Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col QNAM    type=Char label="Qualifier Variable Name"
col QVAL    type=Char label="Data Value"
---
S1 | SV | 001 | VISITREA | Unscheduled visit reason
